        <briefdescription>
<para>Run the pass over the function. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This will lower all remaining &apos;objectsize&apos; and &apos;is.constant&apos;` intrinsic calls in this function, even when the argument has no known size or is not a constant respectively. The resulting constant is propagated and conditional branches are resolved where possible. This complements the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">Instruction</ref> Simplification and <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">Instruction</ref> Combination passes of the optimized pass chain. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
